                            "не требующий платы, компенсации"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "de3b2597-325f-4d0d-8503-2b536458934d",
                                "sense_id": "a7e9b470-264a-306b-894a-1ed31214894d",
                                "text": "На этот раз к моей ночевке вне дома были приняты особые меры: по крайней мере, жена моя точно осведомилась о моих намерениях и дала мне дружеский, бескорыстный совет — не утруждать себя после трудов дальним путешествием."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "515d1797-f085-4a7b-b6ad-e98b9ac56149",
                                "sense_id": "a7e9b470-264a-306b-894a-1ed31214894d",
                                "text": "Вот памятник Навои — бескорыстный дар Москве от Узбекистана."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7b1045bb-9179-3f3c-854b-d9e570dd1aaa",
                        "entry_id": "8fb12b66-cad2-35d4-8acf-c0497bfece1f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "лишённый корысти; не требующий вознаграждения за помощь"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "о человеке"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "77313016-d1f3-4d2a-8696-789e42e92b4e",
                                "sense_id": "7b1045bb-9179-3f3c-854b-d9e570dd1aaa",
                                "text": "Жития был трезвого и строгой добродетели; друзей имел немногих, но наилучших, и сам был друг совершенный, великодушный, бескорыстный и любящий вспомоществовать."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3831826-0032-40fd-859f-5700c8f945b9",
                                "sense_id": "7b1045bb-9179-3f3c-854b-d9e570dd1aaa",
                                "text": "Особенно теснил он заведывавшего постройками по артиллерийскому ведомству вотчима матушкина, Ивана Егоровича Фока, который был человек не дальний, но честный и бескорыстный."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8fcc22de-0853-4efa-ad7e-dc08564fb69f",
                        "source_entry_id": "8fb12b66-cad2-35d4-8acf-c0497bfece1f",
                        "target_lang_word": "disinterested",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "disinterested",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7354c94-8071-39a7-b790-f95a3d2b3da3",
                                        "entry_id": "53314e5b-8014-3403-8318-26badc20f9c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having no stake or interest in the outcome, and no conflicts of interest; free of bias, impartial."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9f0ee8c-7ca8-4aae-bf39-2c226ddf0c9f",
                                                "sense_id": "b7354c94-8071-39a7-b790-f95a3d2b3da3",
                                                "text": "Sir, you have a right to that kind of respect, and are arguing for yourself. I am supporting the principle, and am disinterested in doing it, as I have no such right."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a293806a-d196-4124-9fdb-a5b759d47372",
                                                "sense_id": "b7354c94-8071-39a7-b790-f95a3d2b3da3",
                                                "text": "With his disinterested passion for art, he had a real desire to call the attention of the wise to a talent which was in the highest degree original; [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e023f35-95d3-487b-a058-a9a207103ee3",
                                                "sense_id": "b7354c94-8071-39a7-b790-f95a3d2b3da3",
                                                "text": "People are better off abjuring violence, if everyone else agrees to do so, and vesting authority in a disinterested third party."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5afb90c6-b99f-4685-8684-bf6d62a15bd7",
                                                "sense_id": "b7354c94-8071-39a7-b790-f95a3d2b3da3",
                                                "text": "[P]hilosophers of the time [early 20th century] were primarily concerned with epistemology and the foundations of the sciences; they often spoke as if we were separated from the real world by a screen of \"representations\" or \"sense-data\"; they tended to regard our approach to the world as one of disinterested observation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea992807-f847-3aef-8777-437d51b381b7",
                                        "entry_id": "53314e5b-8014-3403-8318-26badc20f9c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Uninterested, lacking interest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "proscribed"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc12db0b-ae39-4818-9c01-e9fae0ba5280",
                                                "sense_id": "ea992807-f847-3aef-8777-437d51b381b7",
                                                "text": "How dis-interested are they in all Worldly matters, since they fling their Wealth and Riches into the Sea."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e1e3fdd-1f0f-4d20-b1b5-7adebb99a9e4",
                                                "sense_id": "ea992807-f847-3aef-8777-437d51b381b7",
                                                "text": "Robin took to wandering again, to intermittent travel from which she came back hours, days later, disinterested."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8768d8c5-124e-4eaf-87ed-c3e91c3b0bbc",
                                                "sense_id": "ea992807-f847-3aef-8777-437d51b381b7",
                                                "text": "Those spotted are usually taught so slowly that they grow disinterested and quit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1f10ce17-eb1b-40e8-80a4-beb184321806",
                        "source_entry_id": "8fb12b66-cad2-35d4-8acf-c0497bfece1f",
                        "target_lang_word": "uneigennützig",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "uneigennützig",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab2e7931-4ed7-3813-a16b-34989853e0a1",
                                        "entry_id": "a4ca98d7-9f12-3331-9156-5a612f2765cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nicht auf seinen eigenen Vorteil bedacht sein"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0f9b47f-b22e-4eee-affd-96b91ad64b9b",
                                                "sense_id": "ab2e7931-4ed7-3813-a16b-34989853e0a1",
                                                "text": "„Dieses Vorhaben war nicht ganz uneigennützig, denn aufgrund des erstarkenden Skandinavismus war zu befürchten, Finnland könnte sich vom Russischen Reich abspalten und erneut Schweden zuwenden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4c6869b7-9c13-4e71-b028-73b782566be1",
                        "source_entry_id": "8fb12b66-cad2-35d4-8acf-c0497bfece1f",
                        "target_lang_word": "bezinteresowny",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bezinteresowny",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc8f4a40-a475-31f1-bd45-5cb9201e3e1a",
                                        "entry_id": "3c60355c-e7b4-356e-8cfb-db945724e7b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "taki, który nie oczekuje korzyści ze swoich szlachetnych działań, czynów, dobrych uczynków"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b20aabb5-7aa7-4312-9b0c-2d76874d675e",
                                                "sense_id": "cc8f4a40-a475-31f1-bd45-5cb9201e3e1a",
                                                "text": "Uczy też, że jeśli nie potrafimy objąć miłością psa, konika polnego czy owcy, to nie będziemy również zdolni do bezinteresownej miłości do drugiego człowieka."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
